            "buttonStyle": "primary",
            "heading": "Give where it’s needed most",
            "intro": "Give once, or give monthly. Monthly gifts are how we keep showing up.",
            "items": [],
            "note": "You will finish on our giving page at Zeffy. You can choose one time or monthly there.",
            "summary": "Our work is much more than a handout. A direct gift keeps case management going: housing assessments, resource navigation, referrals, warm handoffs, benefits enrollment, peer support and advocacy."
